repository-code: https://github.com/takeisue1270/Plasmid_Protocol_Builder
url: https://github.com/takeisue1270/Plasmid_Protocol_Builder
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that builds bench-protocol workbooks for HiFi assembly
  and Golden Gate assembly from a design table, given as a CSV file or as one
  block of a project workbook. The rows are written to the Data sheet of an
  Excel template whose other sheets are formulas: restriction digestion, PCR,
  assembly mix, oligo annealing, ligation mix and transformation. Reagent
  volumes and conditions are documented and meant to be edited.
keywords:
  - molecular cloning
  - Golden Gate assembly
  - HiFi assembly
  - bench protocol
  - plasmid construction
